uro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5jPzU88Kg-oQ7kNvwEbT323&_nc_oc=AdoZPQ0tXdhUzOyKU54MXNYl8_x677AmQmV1wa738OH9FFGPAGOQVXgKbGr44cCl7TE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFwLZ6_uw9tckui_C4tp9t3er_HQn1mqLy9fc8eiolWMA&oe=6A8EE5A3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PhTNkAWmyNQQ7kNvwHGeP8-&_nc_oc=AdqnAbYSYGHeA0YAiF2_eHLQAOhhLiBXCptj2PDwLGnHt22tK3F5nXZWnFEBjV84qCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEGAlHiUalr5Qd2RPBJf_VvxN6NLwkXKhjn6oIYVcf2-A&oe=6A8ED19D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KxSR9mKvNmwQ7kNvwEEv8dE&_nc_oc=AdojWskV7UPzcZ_cw7OGknMooP_G569mDHeT_E6KJJVCWA5pd3uObfTpE8EoCtOj5wA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFw7b7Ewdxav58Sy59CUKVSAw7ajfedWVZ40z1h2QkEDA&oe=6A8EC00A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_1061729115797769_7442033601794403369_n.png?_nc_cat=109&c